; REFUSABLE DIVERGENCE — a claim naming a target the world does not have is Rejected(unknown_spinner) by
; name, with a receipt. rd_in is the entry, fed by the grant router.
[relay:rd_in]{sig_in, sig_out}
[spinner:rd_real](w=16, n=8, rotor=quarter_turn_z, configurable){sig_in, socket}
[orb:rd_view]{pose}

[rd_in] --sig--> [rd_real]
[rd_real] --socket--> [rd_view]
